      "content": [
        {
          "note": "Each month's figure is the annual-compounding \"120% AFR\" in the Mid-term block of Table 1 of that month's revenue ruling, read from the IRS PDF on 2026-10-10. The IRS index of rulings is https://www.irs.gov/applicable-federal-rates ."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "Rule",
      "content": [
        "Notice 2022-6 sec. 2.02(c): the interest rate may be any rate not more than the greater of 5% or 120% of the federal mid-term rate under IRC 1274(d) for either of the two months immediately preceding the month the distribution begins (`floor_rate` 0.05) — https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-drop/n-22-06.pdf"
      ]
    },
